WEBVTT

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:17.940
I disappeared

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.320
Chase me

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:28.440
And say the words that I need to hear

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:35.580
That I'm burdened, not so worthless

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:39.700
Bet so much that I just might break

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:45.770
Dooming, so confusing

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:49.190
The questions that keep me awake

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:54.350
Would anyone care, would anyone cry

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:59.220
If I finally stepped off of this ledge tonight

00:01:01.630 --> 00:01:05.080
Change what you won't be just fine

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:09.660
Cause I need a reason to not throw the fight

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:12.940
It just might save my life

00:01:39.020 --> 00:01:42.140
Lie is so hard to hide

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:45.940
I've never felt worthy of love

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.540
Move up everything I have

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.900
Just to feel good enough

00:01:55.900 --> 00:01:57.580
If you die

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:39.050
If you finally gave up and turned out the light

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:43.920
The world would be changed if you left it behind

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:47.150
It can't be replaced, no

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:51.830
Tonight is the night you take back your life

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:01.150
See you back.
